      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "MINIMAX H3 RAVEN MASTER PRODUCTION STUDIO \u2014 OPERATIONAL GUIDE\n\n1. \ud83c\udfac HOW TIMELINE DIRECTOR INGESTS (Prompt Box vs JSON vs Screenplay Files):\n   \u2022 Interactive Prompt Box: Type or paste multi-shot scripts directly with [Shot 1], [Shot 2], etc.\n   \u2022 JSON Ingestion: Paste comfyui_chain_plan.json or connect plan_json_input \u2014 it auto-detects JSON and parses shots instantly.\n   \u2022 File Path Ingestion: Type a local screenplay path (e.g. 'screenplays/halo_2005/') and it auto-loads scenes!\n   \u2022 Shot Mode Dropdown: Choose 'Continuous_Sequence (All Shots Combined)' for seamless streaming, or pick 'Shot 1', 'Shot 2' to test individual beats.\n\n2. \ud83e\udde0 ATTENTION ENGINE (Comfy-Kitchen / SDPA vs SageAttention):\n   \u2022 SageAttention 2.2 is 100% OPTIONAL: If SageAttention is not installed, RAVEN automatically falls back to ComfyUI's native PyTorch SDPA / Comfy-Kitchen backend without errors.\n   \u2022 Nobody needs to deal with tricky C++ compiler hassles if they prefer native ComfyUI attention.\n\n3. \u26a1 LoRA RULES & WHY NO TURBO LoRA:\n   \u2022 RAVEN already has its own dedicated 4-step consistency turbo LoRA baked directly into the model loader at strength 1.0!\n   \u2022 NEVER stack an 8-step Turbo LoRA on top: two different turbo schedulers will clash and distort timesteps.\n   \u2022 Content LoRAs work great: 35mm Cinema (CinematicMH3-V01), Red Dragon Camera, Combat LoRA, Realism LoRA.\n   \u2022 Genre / Stylistic LoRAs can be dynamically toggled via the LoRA stack according to scene needs.\n\n4. \ud83d\udce1 LIVE CONTINUOUS STREAMING & RTSP / RTMP:\n   \u2022 WebSocket fMP4: Streams live frames directly to your ComfyUI browser canvas as it generates.\n   \u2022 Local RTSP Server: Set broadcaster to 'RTSP_Stream_Local' and watch live in VLC (Media > Open Network Stream > rtsp://127.0.0.1:8554/live) or OBS Studio.\n   \u2022 RTMP Streaming: Set to 'RTMP_Stream_YouTube' or 'Twitch', enter your stream key, and broadcast 24/7 without frame drops."
      ],
      "color": "#1f3a52",
      "bgcolor": "#132333",
      "title": "\ud83d\udcd8 Director's Master Production Manual"
    }
